                      "parameters":  {
                                         "content":  "## 3. Confirm Recovery Eligibility\n\nThe first IF node confirms that the checkout still appears after the wait period.\n\nThe Prepare SMS Recovery Data node extracts the customer name, phone number, checkout recovery URL, cart value, and SMS marketing consent state.\n\nThe second IF node only allows the SMS path when a phone number, recovery URL, and positive SMS consent are present.",
                                         "height":  520,
                                         "width":  420,
                                         "color":  3
                                     },
                      "id":  "b5a6e9ac-6d54-4d6f-bf4d-ced260eecd00",
