                  {
                      "parameters":  {
                                         "content":  "## 4. Generate And Send SMS\n\nThe AI Agent writes a short abandoned checkout recovery SMS using the prepared Shopify data.\n\nRCSZilla queues the SMS through the Queue Message operation on the sms channel.\n\nThe message keeps a required opt-out line: Reply STOP to opt out. Keep this line when customizing the SMS copy.",
                                         "height":  840,
                                         "width":  920,
                                         "color":  5
                                     },
                      "id":  "5462049f-2c8d-4f94-9475-33b16cbf4074",
