                  {
                      "parameters":  {
                                         "content":  "## 1. Fetch Abandoned Checkouts\n\nThe workflow starts manually for testing. For production, replace this with a Schedule Trigger that runs every 30 to 60 minutes.\n\nThe first HTTP Request reads abandoned Shopify checkouts. Configure the URL with your store domain and connect an HTTP Header Auth credential where the header name is X-Shopify-Access-Token.\n\nRequired Shopify access: abandoned checkout/order read access for the API route you use.",
                                         "height":  600,
                                         "width":  520
                                     },
                      "id":  "c0a92444-8d4d-4eeb-8c8f-7757d90dff2c",
                      "name":  "Sticky Note4",
                      "type":  "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
                      "position":  [
                                       2128,
                                       272
                                   ],
                      "typeVersion":  1
                  },
                  {
                      "parameters":  {
                                         "content":  "## 2. Wait And Recheck\n\nThe Wait node gives shoppers a grace period before any SMS is generated.\n\nAfter one hour, the second Shopify request checks whether the same checkout is still abandoned. If the checkout disappeared from the abandoned list, the workflow stops and does not message the customer.",
                                         "height":  600,
                                         "width":  460
                                     },
                      "id":  "4748bf2d-732b-48f5-a506-01ab5f5ebbe8",
                      "name":  "Sticky Note5",
                      "type":  "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
                      "position":  [
                                       2720,
                                       272
                                   ],
                      "typeVersion":  1
                  },
                  {
                      "parameters":  {
                                         "operation":  "queueMessage",
                                         "to":  "={{ $(\u0027Prepare SMS Recovery Data\u0027).item.json.phone }}",
                                         "message":  "={{$json.output}}",
                                         "channel":  "sms",
                                         "scheduledAt":  ""
                                     },
                      "type":  "n8n-nodes-rcszilla.rcsZilla",
                      "typeVersion":  1,
                      "position":  [
                                       4368,
                                       448
                                   ],
                      "id":  "b00f271d-7643-4180-8e43-fe896478fd05",
                      "name":  "RCSZilla"
                  },
                  {
                      "parameters":  {
                                         "promptType":  "define",
                                         "text":  "=Write one concise abandoned checkout recovery SMS for {{ $json.customerName }}. Cart total: {{ $json.totalPrice }} {{ $json.currency }}. Recovery link: {{ $json.checkoutUrl }}. Cart items JSON: {{ $json.cartSummary }}. Requirements: under 320 characters, friendly, no subject line, no email formatting, include the exact phrase \u0027Reply STOP to opt out.\u0027",
                                         "options":  {

                                                     }
                                     },
                      "id":  "ecbb99d3-d896-48cc-b6b1-72e178329a3c",
                      "name":  "Generate Recovery SMS",
                      "type":  "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
                      "position":  [
                                       4000,
                                       448
                                   ],
                      "typeVersion":  1.9
                  },
                  {
                      "parameters":  {
                                         "jsCode":  "const checkout = $(\u0027Get Initial Abandoned Checkout\u0027).item.json.checkouts?.[0] ?? {};\nfunction present(v){return v !== undefined \u0026\u0026 v !== null \u0026\u0026 String(v).trim() !== \u0027\u0027;}\nfunction pick(...values){return values.find(present) ?? \u0027\u0027;}\nfunction cleanPhone(v){if(!present(v)) return \u0027\u0027; const s=String(v).trim(); if(s.startsWith(\u0027+\u0027)) return \u0027+\u0027 + s.slice(1).replace(/\\D/g, \u0027\u0027); return s.replace(/[^\\d+]/g, \u0027\u0027);}\nconst customer = checkout.customer ?? {};\nconst phone = cleanPhone(pick(checkout.phone, customer.phone, checkout.shipping_address?.phone, checkout.billing_address?.phone));\nconst firstName = pick(customer.first_name, checkout.customer_first_name, \u0027\u0027);\nconst lastName = pick(customer.last_name, checkout.customer_last_name, \u0027\u0027);\nconst customerName = [firstName, lastName].filter(Boolean).join(\u0027 \u0027) || \u0027customer\u0027;\nconst checkoutUrl = pick(checkout.abandoned_checkout_url, checkout.web_url, checkout.checkout_url, checkout.url);\nconst smsConsentRaw = pick(checkout.buyer_accepts_sms_marketing, customer.accepts_marketing, customer.sms_marketing_consent?.state, customer.sms_marketing_consent?.marketing_state, checkout.smsConsent);\nconst smsConsent = smsConsentRaw === true || [\u0027true\u0027,\u0027yes\u0027,\u00271\u0027,\u0027subscribed\u0027,\u0027SUBSCRIBED\u0027].includes(String(smsConsentRaw).trim());\nconst totalPrice = pick(checkout.total_price, checkout.totalPrice, checkout.total_line_items_price);\nconst currency = pick(checkout.currency, checkout.presentment_currency);\nconst cartSummary = JSON.stringify(checkout.line_items ?? checkout.lineItems ?? []);\nconst eligible = Boolean(phone \u0026\u0026 checkoutUrl \u0026\u0026 smsConsent);\nreturn [{json:{eligible, skipReason: eligible ? \u0027\u0027 : \u0027Missing phone, recovery URL, or SMS marketing consent\u0027, phone, checkoutUrl, customerName, firstName, totalPrice, currency, cartSummary, checkout}}];"
                                     },
